  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Choose one of the web app ideas below.\r\n\r\n2. Create wireframes for **four** pages that clearly show:\r\n   - how each page is organized\r\n   - what content appears on each page\r\n   - how a user would move between pages (show at least **one** path)\r\n\r\n**Note:** If you're working with a partner, each of you should create **2 pages** (4 in total).\r\n\r\n3. Save your wireframes to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Choose one of these web app ideas:**\r\n\r\n- Local food vendor app\r\n- School club app\r\n- Art gallery app\r\n- Fitness tracker app\r\n- Online bookstore\r\n- Pet adoption app\r\n- Travel guide for a city or country\r\n- Event planning or ticketing app\r\n- Gaming leaderboard or stats tracker\r\n- Recipe or cooking app\r\n- Language learning app\r\n",
